(7145351, 1095641, 30712, '<td valign="top">This is such a delightfully simple image.  The reflections in the water make a powerful statement which benefit from the lack of clutter.  The bird is the icing on the cake or should that be the fairy on the tree?</td>', 'This is such a delightfully simple image.  The reflections in the water make a powerful statement which benefit from the lack of clutter.  The bird is the icing on the cake or should that be the fairy on the tree?', '2013-12-20 16:41:23.000000', NULL, 1),
