(7145590, 1095115, 16046, '<td valign="top">Focus?</td>', 'Focus?', '2013-12-21 18:49:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7145592, 1095511, 16046, '<td valign="top">Best in show award, congrats</td>', 'Best in show award, congrats', '2013-12-21 18:51:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7146211, 1095629, 62249, '<td valign="top">This is a nice try. The straight on, centered composition makes the shot less interesting than it might otherwise be.</td>', 'This is a nice try. The straight on, centered composition makes the shot less interesting than it might otherwise be.', '2013-12-23 09:48:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7146212, 1095498, 62249, '<td valign="top">Rather a shoehorn for the challenge, but an interesting shot nonetheless.</td>', 'Rather a shoehorn for the challenge, but an interesting shot nonetheless.', '2013-12-23 09:51:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7146213, 1095641, 62249, '<td valign="top">Lovely. The bluish cast in the rippling water is really nice. How long did you have to wait to get the bird in just the right spot?</td>', 'Lovely. The bluish cast in the rippling water is really nice. How long did you have to wait to get the bird in just the right spot?', '2013-12-23 09:52:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7146214, 1095551, 62249, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective. Maybe it needs a bit more depth of field.</td>', 'Interesting perspective. Maybe it needs a bit more depth of field.', '2013-12-23 09:54:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7146215, 1095382, 62249, '<td valign="top">A pretty composition. Might''ve been even nicer with a bit of fill light on the lower right portion of the gold ornament.</td>', 'A pretty composition. Might''ve been even nicer with a bit of fill light on the lower right portion of the gold ornament.', '2013-12-23 09:55:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7146216, 1095576, 62249, '<td valign="top">A cute snowman. Try adjusting your white balance so the snowman looks white instead of yellow.</td>', 'A cute snowman. Try adjusting your white balance so the snowman looks white instead of yellow.', '2013-12-23 09:56:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7146217, 1095630, 62249, '<td valign="top">A refreshingly different take on the theme. I like the graphic quality of the shot. Maybe push the contrast a bit more to make the blacks a little blacker instead of gray.</td>', 'A refreshingly different take on the theme. I like the graphic quality of the shot. Maybe push the contrast a bit more to make the blacks a little blacker instead of gray.', '2013-12-23 09:58:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7146218, 1095646, 62249, '<td valign="top">Adjust the white balance so that white items in the scene don''t look so yellow. Compositionally, I suggest either moving out a bit so that the elf''s feet aren''t cut off, or instead cropping in closer so we can see his drum but not so much of his legs.</td>', 'Adjust the white balance so that white items in the scene don''t look so yellow. Compositionally, I suggest either moving out a bit so that the elf''s feet aren''t cut off, or instead cropping in closer so we can see his drum but not so much of his legs.', '2013-12-23 10:01:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7146220, 1095436, 62249, '<td valign="top">The scene is too contrasty in the harsh light. A viewer''s eye is drawn to the person, who is too dark to see very well and doesn''t appear to be doing anything particularly interesting. One has to search for the snowman in the scene. Maybe if you changed the angle of view by moving to the right so that the person''s back was in the foreground with the snowman still visible, the shot would be more effective.</td>', 'The scene is too contrasty in the harsh light. A viewer''s eye is drawn to the person, who is too dark to see very well and doesn''t appear to be doing anything particularly interesting. One has to search for the snowman in the scene. Maybe if you changed the angle of view by moving to the right so that the person''s back was in the foreground with the snowman still visible, the shot would be more effective.', '2013-12-23 10:07:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7146221, 1095592, 62249, '<td valign="top">A pretty ornament. Not quite in focus.</td>', 'A pretty ornament. Not quite in focus.', '2013-12-23 10:07:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7146222, 1095115, 62249, '<td valign="top">Nothing is in particular focus, so it''s hard to know what to look at in this shot.</td>', 'Nothing is in particular focus, so it''s hard to know what to look at in this shot.', '2013-12-23 10:08:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7147021, 1095070, 3102, '<td valign="top">An awesome scene... I think it would have been a better composition tilted down just a tad, without as much ceiling.</td>', 'An awesome scene... I think it would have been a better composition tilted down just a tad, without as much ceiling.', '2013-12-25 09:09:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7147311, 1095640, 150277, '<td valign="top">This is neat.  I love the variety, and the colors really pop.</td>', 'This is neat.  I love the variety, and the colors really pop.', '2013-12-25 19:13:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7147312, 1095551, 150277, '<td valign="top">I like the perspective.  Pretty background.</td>', 'I like the perspective.  Pretty background.', '2013-12-25 19:14:39.000000', NULL, 1),
