(7147670, 1095395, 14476, '<td valign="top">This scene looks as if it has been assembled over the years and has turned into a family tradition.  Well put together and a delight to look at.  (Maybe a stronger dof would get those front runners in focus too?)</td>', 'This scene looks as if it has been assembled over the years and has turned into a family tradition.  Well put together and a delight to look at.  (Maybe a stronger dof would get those front runners in focus too?)', '2013-12-26 16:25:25.000000', NULL, 1),
