(7147709, 1095592, 14476, '<td valign="top">You found a good looking ornament and captured it quite well.  If it was in a store window, you couldn''t do much about moving the ornaments to either side that were cut, unless you could have found a different angle.</td>', 'You found a good looking ornament and captured it quite well.  If it was in a store window, you couldn''t do much about moving the ornaments to either side that were cut, unless you could have found a different angle.', '2013-12-26 16:53:09.000000', NULL, 1),
