(7148164, 1095641, 54446, '<td valign="top">Congrats, vawendy, on your blue ribbon.  While it''s hard to say for sure the id of the waterfowl, my best guess, based on silhouette would be a Common Loon.</td>', 'Congrats, vawendy, on your blue ribbon.  While it''s hard to say for sure the id of the waterfowl, my best guess, based on silhouette would be a Common Loon.', '2013-12-27 11:42:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(7148166, 1095641, 114969, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Venser:</b></div><hr/><i>if the duck was traversing the scene and in a different location for each exposure, I don''t see how this can''t get DQ''ed given the precedence set before it.</i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>The submitted image is probably the result of only one of the three shots (at least it seems perfectly doable, editing-wise), in which case there shouldn''t be any problem with validation.</td>', 'Originally posted by Venser:if the duck was traversing the scene and in a different location for each exposure, I don''t see how this can''t get DQ''ed given the precedence set before it.  The submitted image is probably the result of only one of the three shots (at least it seems perfectly doable, editing-wise), in which case there shouldn''t be any problem with validation.', '2013-12-27 11:46:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(7148168, 1095262, 14476, '<td valign="top"><b>Wow, a Harley driver and a set designer!  <br/>You''re amazing, <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=161988" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Trotterjay</a> - and a good sport,<br/>as well as a good photographer.<br/> <br/>Happy Holidays to you.<br/> <br/>Alice</b></td>', 'Wow, a Harley driver and a set designer!  You''re amazing,  Trotterjay - and a good sport,as well as a good photographer. Happy Holidays to you. Alice', '2013-12-27 11:56:50.000000', NULL, 0),
