(7148687, 1095641, 141319, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by vawendy:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by vawendy:</b></div><hr/><i> <br/> <br/>I only used one of the three exposures in this image.  The bracketing was because I was unsure of what exposure I would need. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>typed by Jeff since Wendy is making lefse! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Just learned something new - never heard of lefse before. By the looks of the recipe, it sounds like a tricky thing to make, but "reads" delicious :-). Off to make a common omlett for my husband''s breakfast with home eggs.</td>', 'Originally posted by vawendy: Originally posted by vawendy:  I only used one of the three exposures in this image.  The bracketing was because I was unsure of what exposure I would need.   typed by Jeff since Wendy is making lefse!   Just learned something new - never heard of lefse before. By the looks of the recipe, it sounds like a tricky thing to make, but "reads" delicious :-). Off to make a common omlett for my husband''s breakfast with home eggs.', '2013-12-29 02:35:52.000000', NULL, 0),
